**/fastlane/Preview.html
**/fastlane/screenshots
**/fastlane/test_output
fastlane/README.md

# ===== VSCode =====
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ===== Logs =====
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# ===== Buck =====
buck-out/
.buckconfig.local
.buckd/

